# Policy files: every change needs the project owner's review.
# Bootstrap replaces @CONFIGURE_ME with the real GitHub user or team, e.g. @your-name.
# Enable "Require review from Code Owners" in branch protection for this to bind
# (python3 .genesis/tools/genesis.py governance --apply does it, after the owner approves).
# The project's own folders (src/, docs/, tools/, prompts/, BLUEPRINT.md ...) need no entry.
/engineering.json   @CONFIGURE_ME
/.genesis/          @CONFIGURE_ME
/.github/           @CONFIGURE_ME
/.claude/           @CONFIGURE_ME
/.githooks/         @CONFIGURE_ME
/.agents/           @CONFIGURE_ME
/AGENTS.md          @CONFIGURE_ME
/CLAUDE.md          @CONFIGURE_ME
/START_HERE.md      @CONFIGURE_ME
/skills-lock.json   @CONFIGURE_ME
